<entry><title>Donating Agent Skills to the Agentic AI Foundation</title><link href="https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/22/donating-agent-skills/" rel="alternate"/><published>2026-10-22T18:09:56+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-22T18:09:56+00:00</updated><id>https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/22/donating-agent-skills/</id><summary type="html">
    
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-agent-skills-to-the-agentic-ai-foundation"&gt;Donating Agent Skills to the Agentic AI Foundation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
News today from Anthropic:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to keeping Agent Skills open, community-driven, and vendor-neutral. Today, we are donating the standard to the Agentic AI Foundation (AAIF) under the Linux Foundation, &lt;a href="https://www.anthropic.com/news/donating-the-model-context-protocol-and-establishing-of-the-agentic-ai-foundation"&gt;which we co-founded&lt;/a&gt; with Block and OpenAI last year, and to which we donated the Model Context Protocol (MCP).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I'm pleased to note I called this one &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/2025/Dec/19/agent-skills/"&gt;last December&lt;/a&gt;, when Anthropic first declared skills to be an "open standard":&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I wouldn't be surprised to see this end up &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/2025/Dec/9/agentic-ai-foundation/"&gt;in the AAIF&lt;/a&gt;, recently the new home of the MCP specification.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fun side note: since my blog content is available to Claude via the &lt;a href="https://github.com/datasette/datasette-mcp"&gt;datasette-mcp&lt;/a&gt;
plugin I found that post by &lt;a href="https://claude.ai/share/80b341de-590b-4834-bca9-0d9c9a3a0298"&gt;prompting Claude&lt;/a&gt; to "&lt;code&gt;Use simonwillison.net MCP to find if I ever talked about how I want skills to be donated to a standards body&lt;/code&gt;".


    &lt;p&gt;Tags: &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/tags/standards"&gt;standards&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/tags/ai"&gt;ai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/tags/generative-ai"&gt;generative-ai&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/tags/llms"&gt;llms&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/tags/anthropic"&gt;anthropic&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/tags/model-context-protocol"&gt;model-context-protocol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/tags/skills"&gt;skills&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;



</summary><category term="standards"/><category term="ai"/><category term="generative-ai"/><category term="llms"/><category term="anthropic"/><category term="model-context-protocol"/><category term="skills"/></entry>
